+---
+id: task-004-restore-welcome-coupons-and-free-delivery-threshold
+type: task
+title: "Restore welcome coupons and free delivery threshold"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Fix two reported order-service defects:
+
+- When a customer cancels an order that used a single-use coupon within the permitted cancellation period, release the coupon so they can use it on a corrected order. Preserve single-use restrictions while an order is active and existing cancellation rules.
+- Free delivery applies when the goods amount is exactly €50.00 after discounts and before VAT. Ensure the comparison includes the threshold.
+
+Add regression coverage for both reports and run the existing test suite. Keep README business rules aligned with implemented behaviour.
